# Keys inside the prasar screen, for Vayu's keybinding search
# (keybind-search.py reads ~/.tmux/plugins/*/scripts). Generated from
# internal/tui/keys.go by `go test ./internal/tui -update`; don't edit.
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | Ctrl+S | Post it now (LinkedIn goes out, X opens in your browser; asks first) (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | Ctrl+T | Schedule it (tomorrow 9am, fri 6pm, in 2h...) (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | Ctrl+D | Save it as a draft (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | Ctrl+X | Toggle posting to X (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | Ctrl+L | Toggle posting to LinkedIn (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | Ctrl+O | Add an image (a path; Ctrl+O on an empty line removes them) (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | Ctrl+N | Start a new post (the current one stays as it was saved) (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | Esc | Leave the editor (the other keys work then) (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | i / Enter | Edit the post (Compose tab)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | Tab / Shift+Tab | Switch to the next / previous tab
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | 1 – 4 | Switch to Compose, Queue, Drafts or Posted
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | L | Open LinkedIn's sign-in again (it lasts 60 days)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | ? | Show every key
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | q | Quit
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | j / k | Move to the next / previous post (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | Enter / e | Edit the post in Compose (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | p | Post it now (asks first) (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | t | Schedule it, or move it to another time (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | o | Open it on X's page to press Post (and confirm it after) (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | a | Approve an agent's post (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | n | Decline an agent's post (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | r | Send a post LinkedIn refused again (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | c | Cancel a scheduled or waiting post (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | d | Delete the draft (asks first) (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | y | Copy the post's link (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | v | Open the post's link in the browser (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | Enter | Confirm it's posted on X (paste its link first for a thread's next part) (X popup)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | Ctrl+O | Open X's page again (X popup)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | Ctrl+K | Cancel X for this post (LinkedIn is unaffected) (X popup)
# keybind: Tmux/prasar | Esc | Leave it for later (it waits in Queue) (X popup)
